title: "Spectral Decision of the BSD Conjecture: A Spectral-Geometric Proof via YuanXian Theory (YD-T64 & TCSC)"
abstract: "We propose a novel spectral-geometric proof of the Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer conjecture by embedding elliptic curves into the YD-T64 complex geometric framework and constructing a self-adjoint elliptic operator whose zero eigenvalue multiplicity corresponds to both the algebraic and analytic ranks."
